{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EARLY ACCESS: Current Patch:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular Patch 022 (4.18.2025)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beta Patch 023 (4.19.2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong><u>Tutorial is HIGHLY RECOMMENDED</u></strong> even if having played the demo as there are differences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Merchant's Promise</strong>\u00a0features\u00a0<strong>No Inventory &amp; Physics-based Inspired\u00a0</strong>gameplay.\u00a0You are in <strong>full control</strong> of the item you handle from the time you pick them up until you put them down...or throw them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Merchant Status is everything and will determine how easily you can adjust your prices to make the most profit.\u00a0There is also a <strong>Permanent Death</strong> option for those that like more risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Starting as a lowly\u00a0<strong>Merchant</strong>\u00a0you can eventually earn your way to a\u00a0<strong>King's Merchant </strong>through trading as you experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item Loss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light survival elements (hunger, thirst, health, and stamina)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Merchant's Promise will not micro-manage you:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited Menus and UI's as possible...and still trying to be reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No &quot;Objectives&quot; or &quot;Tasks&quot; will pop up telling you what to do and how to do it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Talk</strong>, <strong>Read</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>Interact</strong> with things to learn about the world you play in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>...did I mention the <strong>Main Game Tutorial  is strongly encouraged?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game receives regular updates and is worked on Full Time (+)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Priorities of Continued EA Development:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Game World</strong> - After ensuring a Solid Foundation of current gameplay mechanics I will be working hard to bring more elements of &quot;life&quot; and &quot;depth&quot; into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NPCs</strong> - I assure you...they cause me pain to watch as well! They will be improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Consistent &amp; Reliable gameplay</strong> - Physics games are quirky and a lot of adjustments are always being made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Performance</strong> - No one wants a 47GB game download that gets 12FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gets the bugs out</strong> - I  handle these through the Discord Reporting (Link on Store Page) as soon as possible with a ticket system so you can stay up-to-date on your issue's progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you for taking the time to visit and I look forward to providing you with a great product and fun challenge!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2932960?t=1745154682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932960/4fb0369c023954c8853c3c236cabc1cf311cefef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745154682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932960/22c56c7f88314ab33e141e